e font-bold transition-colors duration-300\">البرامج</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-brand-silver hover:text-white font-bold transition-colors duration-300\">المدربون</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-brand-silver hover:text-white font-bold transition-colors duration-300\">قصص النجاح</a>\n                    <button class=\"mr-6 px-6 py-2 bg-brand-orange text-white font-black uppercase tracking-wide sharp-edge hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all duration-300\">\n                        تسجيل الدخول\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"md:hidden\">\n                    <button class=\"text-brand-silver focus:outline-none hover:text-brand-orange transition\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <section class=\"relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-20\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-orange/10 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 -left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-orange/5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12\">\n                \n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 mb-12 lg:mb-0 lg:pl-12 z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-6 border border-brand-orange/30 bg-brand-orange/10 text-brand-orange font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase sharp-edge\">\n                        مجتمع رياضي للنخبة\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-tight mb-6 uppercase tracking-tight\">\n                        <span class=\"block text-white\">اصقل جسدك.</span>\n                        <span class=\"block text-neon\">اكسر حدودك.</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-silver mb-10 max-w-lg font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n                        هنا لا مكان للأعذار. انضم إلى مجتمع احترافي يجمع بين القوة البدنية، الصلابة الذهنية، والانتماء الحقيقي. تدرب تحت إشراف نخبة من المدربين المعتمدين لتصل إلى أفضل نسخة من نفسك.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\">\n                        <button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-brand-orange text-white font-black text-lg uppercase tracking-wide sharp-edge hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                            احجز حصة تجريبية\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-brand-gray text-brand-silver font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-wide sharp-edge hover:border-brand-silver hover:text-white transition-all duration-300\">\n                            اكتشف البرامج\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-t border-brand-gray pt-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white mb-1\">+500</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm text-brand-silver font-bold uppercase\">قصة نجاح</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white mb-1\">12</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm text-brand-silver font-bold uppercase\">مدرب محترف</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl font-black text-brand-orange mb-1\">24/7</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm text-brand-silver font-bold uppercase\">دخول غير محدود</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] max-h-[800px]\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-2 border-brand-gray transform translate-x-4 translate-y-4 z-0 sharp-edge\"></div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark sharp-edge overflow-hidden z-10 border border-brand-gray/50\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?q=80&w=1470&auto=format&fit=crop\" \n                                 alt=\"رياضي يتدرب بقوة\" \n                                 class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center image-hardcore transform hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                            \n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-black via-transparent to-transparent opacity-80\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-black/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 -right-6 z-20 bg-brand-black border border-brand-gray p-4 sharp-edge shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center sharp-edge animate-pulse-slow\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-white font-black uppercase text-sm\">معدات عالمية</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-brand-silver text-xs\">صممت للأبطال</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 hidden md:flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-brand-silver uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">تمرير للأسفل</span>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-12 bg-brand-gray overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-1/2 bg-brand-orange animate-[float_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</body>\n</html>"
